    "description": "Expert NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) advisor covering CSF 2.0 and CSF 1.1. Use this skill whenever a user asks about NIST CSF, cybersecurity risk management, the six CSF functions (Govern, Identify, Protect, Detect, Respond, Recover), CSF profiles, implementation tiers, gap assessments, organizational profiles, community profiles, CSF core subcategories, informative references, or mapping to other frameworks (NIST SP 800-53, ISO 27001, CIS Controls, COBIT). Also trigger for questions like \"how do I implement NIST CSF?\", \"what does CSF 2.0 change?\", \"help me build a CSF profile\", \"how do I assess my cybersecurity posture?\", or any request involving organizational cybersecurity risk strategy or framework alignment.\n",
